/* The slider control (BACKLOG-0002340): a track holding one thumb (two in
   range mode). The track's --lattice-slider-track reads the field surface
   role, and the fill/thumb read --lattice-slider-fill, chosen so the fill
   clears 3:1 against the track in every preset's light and dark theme (the
   accent colour against the field surface, never the plain background, is
   the one pairing that holds across all four). */
